flowchart LR
    Send["sendmsg(fd, buf)<br/><b>does:</b> hands datagram to UDP socket<br/><b>why next:</b> UDP must build one skb per datagram<br/><b>state:</b> user bytes + destination"]
    UdpSend["udp_sendmsg<br/><b>does:</b> validates size, corking, checksum mode, route<br/><b>why next:</b> IP output owns L3 headers and routing<br/><b>state:</b> skb with UDP header/payload"]
    IpOut["ip_send_skb / ip_local_out<br/><b>does:</b> applies LOCAL_OUT, route output, POST_ROUTING<br/><b>why next:</b> accepted skb can be queued to device<br/><b>state:</b> dst, marks, NAT/checksum updates"]
    Wire["wire<br/><b>state:</b> independent datagram; no stream state"]
    UdpRcv["udp_rcv<br/><b>does:</b> validates checksum and UDP header<br/><b>why next:</b> socket lookup decides owner or ICMP error<br/><b>state:</b> skb ready for UDP demux"]
    Lookup["__udp4_lib_lookup<br/><b>does:</b> hashes by port/address with reuse rules<br/><b>why next:</b> matching socket gets receive queue ownership<br/><b>state:</b> selected sk or no listener"]
    Found{"listener found?"}
    Drop["ICMP port unreachable / drop<br/><b>does:</b> reports no owner when policy allows<br/><b>state:</b> skb consumed"]
    Queue["socket receive queue<br/><b>does:</b> enqueues skb and charges socket memory<br/><b>why next:</b> sleeping reader must be notified<br/><b>state:</b> datagram waits intact"]
    Wake["sk_data_ready<br/><b>does:</b> wakes poll/recvmsg waiters<br/><b>why next:</b> app can copy exactly one datagram<br/><b>state:</b> userspace observable readiness"]
    Recv["recvmsg(fd)<br/><b>does:</b> dequeues one skb and copies payload<br/><b>state:</b> datagram delivered or truncated per flags"]

    Send --> UdpSend --> IpOut --> Wire --> UdpRcv --> Lookup --> Found
    Found -->|no| Drop
    Found -->|yes| Queue --> Wake --> Recv

    classDef tx fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef rx fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef decision fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
